<title>USA: Tribune nominates Aon's Ryan as director.</title>
<headline>Tribune nominates Aon's Ryan as director.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tribune Co said Wednesday it nominated Patrick Ryan, chairman, president and chief executive officer of Aon Corp, to serve as a director.</p>
<p>His election at the May 6 annual shareholders meeting would expand the media company's board to 12 members.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
